stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Bandit_A</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Bandit_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Bandit_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">2f63906e-259e-49af-a8a8-7d3f7c7587a8</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2f63906e-259e-49af-a8a8-7d3f7c7587a8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2f63906e-259e-49af-a8a8-7d3f7c7587a8\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Worn by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Shadowheart has this armour equipped if all of the following conditions are met:\n<ol><li>She was recruited on the <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nautiloid</a>.</li>\n<li>She has no armour equipped and no armour in her inventory at the end of the <a href=\"/wiki/Prologue\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prologue\">Prologue</a>.</li>\n<li>She was not recruited again on the <a href=\"/wiki/Ravaged_Beach\" title=\"Ravaged Beach\">Ravaged Beach</a>.</li></ol>\n<ul><li>Prior to Patch 7, she also had this armour equipped on the Ravaged Beach if the first two conditions were met.</li></ul></li>\n<li>This armour has the same appearance as regular <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leather_Armour\" title=\"Leather Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Leather_Armour\" title=\"Leather Armour\">Leather Armour</a> when equipped.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202550\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2134/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25988/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6324/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1160343/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.245      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%   62.245      1 -total\n 26.49%   16.488      6 Template:Icon_text\n 24.35%   15.158     22 Template:Trim\n 20.56%   12.798      3 Template:Icon_link\n 18.46%   11.488      2 Template:WeaponType\n 18.15%   11.299      2 Template:Uid\n 17.36%   10.806      9 Template:Ifempty\n 11.90%    7.407      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 10.59%    6.592      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34615-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202550 and revision id 389069. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}